The '''Rose's End''' is a sub-location of {{Zone|The Mountaintop}}. It serves as a parkour trial leading to an Enigma Soul.

== Enigma Souls ==
{{Enigma Souls}}

== Tips ==
* Holding the Sneak key after landing prevents you from falling off the flower pots.
* It is recommended to upgrade your {{Item|Aspect of the Leech}} to its maximum power using {{Item|Transmission Tuner}}s and {{Item|Super Leech Modifier}}s.

